  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0 - The reading surface states what the document actually says: an image's colour space is resolved instead of guessed, so palette, CMYK, ICCBased and bilevel scans yield pixels (PixelFormat gains Cmyk32, four device samples with no ink conversion), a sample narrower than a byte is widened, and LZWDecode is decoded on the read and the copy route including object streams. Two filters stop misreporting: a name the library has never seen is ImageFilterUnsupported rather than damaged data, and an image whose stream declares no filter finally yields its samples. The form field tree and the signature search share PdfEngineOptions.MaxNestingDepth and now say when they cut, with PdfWarningKind.FormFieldDepthExceeded and PdfSignatureProblemKind.FormFieldTreeTooDeep. The extension conveniences stop copying a payload they already hold and state that a destination path is caller input with no root enforced. Both legs (net10.0, net11.0) ship in one package. Details: https://github.com/MPCoreDeveloper/SharpCorePDF/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
